@linbin-mk/dsh-workspace-prompt README · 要求：- Node.js `^22.19` 或 `>=24`；
- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.3` 或兼容的 `0.2.1` 预发布版本，以及提供 `ctx.settings` / `ctx.configForms` / `ctx.agent` 的 Web profile；会话首次确认还需要 `ctx.userQuestions`（Web profile 默认含 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-user-questions`，缺失时退回开关语义）；
- 本包只在 Web Client 端提供界面，不提供终端或桌面端入口。

@linbin-mk/dsh-workspace-prompt README · Requirements：- Node.js `^22.19` or `>=24`;
- DeepSeek Harness `0.2.1-rc.3` or a compatible `0.2.1` prerelease, with a Web profile that provides `ctx.settings` / `ctx.configForms` / `ctx.agent`; the once-per-session confirmation also needs `ctx.userQuestions` (shipped in the Web profile through `@deepseek-ai/dsh-user-questions`; without it the plugin falls back to the switch);
- The user interface is offered on the Web Client only; there is no terminal or desktop entry point.
